    "What invitation does Jesus give in Matthew 11:28?": { q: "Ni gukwero gani Yesu anati mu Mathayo 11:28?", options: ["Beri, na munye", "Thunga, na muwone", "Yumani, mwaɓa na mworo motho, na nidi kukuwo shyika", "Pirira, na muwone wazi"], explain: "Mathayo 11:28 ninyi, Yumani, mwaɓa na mworo motho, na nidi kukuwo shyika." },
