    "In the Gerasene demoniac story, where did the man possessed by demons live?": { q: "Katika cika ya motho wa Gerasa, athibwo wapi motho wa pyepe?", options: ["Katika kori", "Karekwo na aworo makaburini", "Jweri wa mlima", "Katika kanisa"], explain: "Motho wa Gerasa wa pyepe athibwo karekwo na aworo makaburini na akata wakwa." },
    "What is the final message of the Beauty for Ashes teaching?": { q: "Ni umoni wa mwisho wa yeeba yidong inyesinyuos?", options: ["Cikwi coka, na Elohim ana kakuwo huru nek wota maci", "Maci manyori mane ni mwaro", "Maci mamira yanyo kukomboa watu", "Watu maʔiri Elohim areke mangi maci"], explain: "Yeeba cini ni maci: Elohim ana kakuwo huru na kukomboa nek wota maci." }
